lines=['# Recurrent temozolomide 00342: source audit for v0.84.38','',f'Fresh NCCP v4 (23 July 2025) and EMA Temodal PDFs retrieved on 5 November 2026. The current NCCP catalogue links to the retained v4 document. No version update was needed.','',f"Production-engine validation: **{cases['passed']}/{cases['total']} checks passed**, with positive executed witnesses for all **{len(p['rule_engine']['rules'])} rules**. The old assessment has {prior['failed']} failing expectations on the new {prior['total']}-check suite; this is not a distinct-defect count.",'','## Principal findings','']
